<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθημέρ-ιος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθᾱμ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>day by day, daily</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽
				ἡμέραν</span>), neut. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				229
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1414
			</span></i>(dub., lyr.):—later also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθημερινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, δίαιτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ju.</u>
					12.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.141b
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακονία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					6.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					3.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.10c
			</span></i>; of fevers, <i>quotidian</i>, later word for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφημερινός</span> (q.v.), esp. of
				<i>non-remittent quotidians</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.354
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17(1).221
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					275.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρίξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					924.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
